Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:07.40,0:00:14.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（办公室女性湿湿的裤袜）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:07.40,0:00:11.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次新品的发售  应该有点创新
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:11.40,0:00:14.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备好了吧  嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:14.90,0:00:21.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为这次找好了合作者\N（松下纱荣子）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:22.24,0:00:24.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们会支持的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:24.58,0:00:26.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会负贵处理的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:27.24,0:00:28.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:28.41,0:00:31.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,模特没有问题吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:31.75,0:00:32.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有问题\N（阿部智高）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:32.92,0:00:35.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,设计没有问题吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:36.25,0:00:39.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次的设计可以
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:39.59,0:00:42.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也检查了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:42.93,0:00:44.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:44.43,0:00:49.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会是什么样的衣服呢\N（吉井美希  前田浩贵）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:50.10,0:00:51.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好期待啊  嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:51.60,0:00:53.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好期待啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:53.77,0:00:56.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:56.77,0:01:00.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你那么忙还要麻烦你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:00.61,0:01:01.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:01.78,0:01:04.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也该尽一份力
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:04.78,0:01:05.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然厉害
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:05.95,0:01:09.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前就说你厉害  果然可靠
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:09.95,0:01:13.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是做了一点小事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:13.46,0:01:16.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是可是人家点名要你哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:16.79,0:01:22.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长也很器重你\N（导演  大谷卓生）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:22.47,0:01:25.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托了  不要出错
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:25.30,0:01:26.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:26.47,0:01:30.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:31.81,0:01:36.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是大致的  等一下我把详细的发给你们
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:37.31,0:01:38.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:38.82,0:01:44.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好棒啊  这里真的太棒了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:44.16,0:01:49.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的是太有创意了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:49.49,0:01:50.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吧  部长
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:51.00,0:01:52.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:52.50,0:01:53.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:55.00,0:01:56.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:56.67,0:01:58.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:58.50,0:02:01.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有不足的地方
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:01.34,0:02:03.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样不错的话就这样吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:03.34,0:02:04.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:04.84,0:02:06.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:07.85,0:02:14.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的是舒厉害啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:14.85,0:02:24.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是第一次做这个  也想尝试一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:24.70,0:02:25.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就接手了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:26.20,0:02:30.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长喜欢这样的啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:30.03,0:02:34.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你的设计很棒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:34.37,0:02:39.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是很久都没有新作品
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:39.71,0:02:43.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是在探索
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:43.55,0:02:45.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:45.05,0:02:52.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的话一定可以的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:52.56,0:02:54.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:54.39,0:02:58.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  我不行的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:58.06,0:03:00.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:20.58,0:03:22.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去倒茶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:22.42,0:03:24.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用麻烦了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:24.76,0:03:25.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用了  没事的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:30.09,0:03:34.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个设计是不是模仿的哪个啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:35.27,0:03:37.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:37.60,0:03:41.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在哪个地方看过
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:43.11,0:03:44.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:44.94,0:03:46.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交给我吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:46.44,0:03:47.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去调查
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:47.95,0:03:49.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以拜托你吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:49.45,0:03:50.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:50.95,0:03:53.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,部长还有别的事做  交给我吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:53.62,0:03:55.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就拜托了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:55.12,0:03:56.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:00.79,0:04:04.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托了  嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:06.80,0:04:07.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,部长
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:07.63,0:04:11.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,设计的样本做出来了  真的吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:12.14,0:04:13.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:14.64,0:04:16.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不错啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:16.64,0:04:17.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:21.81,0:04:27.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次的设计真的好棒啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:27.49,0:04:28.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:28.49,0:04:32.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次真的不错
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:32.99,0:04:35.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样的话应该可以顺利发售
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:36.16,0:04:37.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:37.66,0:04:38.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,部长
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:39.00,0:04:41.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个设计  不是说这个时候啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:42.00,0:04:43.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:43.50,0:04:48.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人联系说我们窃取他们的设计
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:48.17,0:04:49.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:49.67,0:04:51.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是怎么回事啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:53.34,0:04:57.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说我的设计偷窃他们的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:57.18,0:04:58.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:58.68,0:05:00.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是开什么玩笑啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:01.19,0:05:06.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我先说啊  这是我设计的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:06.86,0:05:10.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能是抄袭的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:10.53,0:05:13.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:13.70,0:05:19.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们在发售的时候应该确认啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:20.04,0:05:24.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说这是一年前的设计
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:24.88,0:05:28.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是在逗我玩玛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:28.71,0:05:31.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们没有这个意思
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:31.22,0:05:36.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们没有确认  真的对不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:36.05,0:05:42.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑  这就是我的设计
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:43.23,0:05:49.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说我的设计跟他们的一徉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:51.07,0:05:52.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是污蔑我吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:53.07,0:05:55.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:57.07,0:06:00.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不要再来公司了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:00.24,0:06:03.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟你们社长说  回去吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:11.09,0:06:13.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟社长打电话了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:13.76,0:06:17.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说不做了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:18.10,0:06:20.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的对不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:21.60,0:06:26.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,网上的设计已经删了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:26.10,0:06:27.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:28.77,0:06:31.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发表会也要延期了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:33.28,0:06:34.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的对不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:35.45,0:06:39.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么你不好好确认啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:39.28,0:06:41.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之前就说了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:42.12,0:06:47.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了不出现这种情况  好好确认啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:47.12,0:06:48.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:48.96,0:06:50.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的错
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:51.13,0:06:54.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的对不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:55.80,0:07:00.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之  社长很生气
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:00.14,0:07:02.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你们了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:02.14,0:07:03.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:17.49,0:07:19.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（杉浦贵）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:28.00,0:07:30.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:30.33,0:07:33.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是惊喜啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:34.00,0:07:37.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:37.84,0:07:41.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:41.51,0:07:43.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我的设计
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:43.35,0:07:45.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请相信我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:46.35,0:07:49.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的  谢谢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:49.69,0:07:52.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜拜
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:57.19,0:08:00.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海外的电话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:01.87,0:08:07.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在对我们的影响很大
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:10.88,0:08:12.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么办呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:14.21,0:08:16.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种情况
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:16.88,0:08:21.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的对不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:32.90,0:08:35.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以后怎么办
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:35.90,0:08:39.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以后吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:41.57,0:08:44.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能有点不自量力
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:44.58,0:08:50.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以后还请您继续给我们设计
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:52.75,0:08:58.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然了  这个我们可以商议
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:59.92,0:09:02.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要多久能出新作品
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:04.43,0:09:08.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没有跟上司商量
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:08.27,0:09:11.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果您能接受的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:13.10,0:09:17.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请您为我们设计
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:25.45,0:09:27.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你糊弄我吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:27.45,0:09:30.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:31.96,0:09:34.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得我是缺钱的人吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:40.80,0:09:43.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是这样认为的吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:46.47,0:09:49.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么  什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:53.31,0:09:57.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想要的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:57.82,0:10:01.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是创作出好的作品
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:01.49,0:10:06.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:07.99,0:10:12.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是像他们那样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:12.50,0:10:15.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要创作出新的作品
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:16.17,0:10:19.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:19.84,0:10:21.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:21.34,0:10:25.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要寻找刺激
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:37.86,0:10:38.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:38.69,0:10:39.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你千嘛啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:41.36,0:10:44.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:48.37,0:10:50.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我下次再来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:51.54,0:10:52.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:59.38,0:11:04.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  顺从我吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:04.55,0:11:06.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在千嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:10.55,0:11:11.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:13.56,0:11:15.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:18.40,0:11:19.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你干嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:24.07,0:11:25.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你干嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:27.07,0:11:29.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你干嘛啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:29.07,0:11:33.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:35.08,0:11:37.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不错啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:37.25,0:11:39.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:39.58,0:11:41.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:41.42,0:11:46.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再继续吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:48.43,0:11:49.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难受吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:52.60,0:11:54.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要啊
